cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its benchmark data, please cite this repository as below.
type: software
title: "RBAi Scholar: API and MCP documentation, client configurations and benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Documentation of the RBAi Scholar REST API and MCP server, configuration
  files for MCP clients, and the benchmark of its semantic, keyword and hybrid
  search of biomedical abstracts: the questions, every system's rankings, the
  blinded relevance grades and a scorer that recomputes every published
  figure from the released data.
authors:
